   "": {
    "actClause": "AN ACT to amend chapter 837 of the laws of 2022, amending the real property\nactions and proceedings law relating to authorizing special proceedings to\nconvey title to abandoned commercial and industrial real property to a city,\ntown, or village, in relation to the effectiveness thereof",
    "basePrintNo": "S8187",
    "basePrintNoStr": "S8187-2025",
    "coSponsors": {
     "items": [],
     "size": 0
    },
    "fullText": "",
    "fullTextFormats": [],
    "fullTextHtml": "",
    "fullTextTemplate": "",
    "lawCode": "Amd §2, Chap 837 of 2022",
    "lawSection": "Real Property",
    "memo": " \nBILL NUMBER: S8187\n\nSPONSOR: COONEY\n \nTITLE OF BILL:\n\nAn act to amend chapter 837 of the laws of 2022, amending the real prop-\nerty actions and proceedings law relating to authorizing special\nproceedings to convey title to abandoned commercial and industrial real\nproperty to a city, town, or village, in relation to the effectiveness\nthereof\n\n \nPURPOSE OF THE BILL:\n\nThis bill would extend Article 19-B of the real property actions and\nproceedings law. Summary of Provisions:\n\nSection 1 of the bill extends, until June 30, 2028, the sunset date of\nArticle 19-B of the real property actions and proceedings law, which\nauthorizes special proceedings to convey title to abandoned commercial\nand industrial real property to a city, town, or village.\n\nSection 2 of the bill provides for an immediate effective date.\n\n \nJUSTIFICATION:\n\nThis bill extends Article 19-B of the real property actions and\nproceedings law, which provides a mechanism by which a special proceed-\ning may be brought to convey title to abandoned commercial and indus-\ntrial real property to a city, town, or village. This special proceeding\nhas been successfully used by localities statewide to reduce blight, and\nit should continue to exist as localities address these problems.\n\n \nPRIOR LEGISLATIVE HISTORY:\n\nThis bill extends law enacted by Chapter 837 of the Laws of 2022.\n\n \nFISCAL IMPLICATIONS:\n\nN/A\n\n \nEFFECTIVE DATE:\nThis act shall take effect immediately.\n",
